extends base

block content
  h1 Welcome to Plete Premium
  p Hi #{firstName},
  p Your subscription to Plete Premium is now active. All monthly AI quota limits have been removed, and you now have full access to every Premium feature across Plete:

  .details-box
    p.section-label Unlimited AI Suite
    .detail-item
      p.detail-value Magic Entries &amp; Receipt OCR Scanning
      p(style='margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;') Log transactions in plain English and scan unlimited physical receipts or handwritten notes.
    .detail-item
      p.detail-value Ask Plete AI &amp; Financial Coach
      p(style='margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;') Unlimited conversational Q&amp;A and personalized coaching tailored to your financial activity.
    .detail-item
      p.detail-value Forecasts, Simulators &amp; AI Reports
      p(style='margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;') Unlimited predictive budget forecasts, what-if savings scenario simulations, monthly executive reports, and spending anomaly insights.

  .details-box
    p.section-label Premium-Only Features
    .detail-item
      p.detail-value 10+ Years History &amp; Multi-Month Trends
      p(style='margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;') Unlock 3M, 6M, 1Y, and up to 10-year lookback filters across your dashboard trends and reports.
    .detail-item
      p.detail-value Instant PDF &amp; Excel Data Exports
      p(style='margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;') Export your transactions, budgets, income, expenses, and savings in PDF or Excel format across custom date ranges.
    .detail-item
      p.detail-value Custom Categories &amp; Auto-Categorization
      p(style='margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;') Create custom categories, customize default categories, and configure keyword rules for automatic categorization.
    .detail-item
      p.detail-value Unlimited Goals &amp; Budget Rollover
      p(style='margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;') Create unlimited financial goals and roll over unspent monthly budget balances into the next month.

  table.btn(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
    tbody
      tr
        td(align='left')
          table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
            tbody
              tr
                td
                  a(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Explore Premium Features

  p Thank you for upgrading to Plete Premium.
  p.signoff — Team Plete


